// All My Tomorrows (Frank Sinatra, 1959)

Tempo 75   // Frank does it at a sleepy 70bpm
Keysig G

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Begin Solo
     Voice VoiceOohs
     Volume F
     Articulate 110
     Octave 5
     Harmony OpenBelow
     Begin Riff
         8.d+;16b;8g;b;8.;16g;4e;
         8g;r;4d;e&;en;
     End
End

Groove StringBalladIntro
Seq 3
Cresc p f 2
Swingmode On
1        G6      / G6(add9)
2         /      G     F7     E7

Repeat
Groove StringBallad 
Volume m

3       Am7
4       Cm6
5       G/B
6    Bbdim7

